# Method to Raise the Dead (Q345): a level 35 character accepts at Dorothy; with no bone she
# asks for them; five crokians give the five victim bones in turn (pinned rolls: the part roll
# 0, then each part); a sixth rolls the arm bone again, already held, and gives useless bone
# pieces; a seventh misses the part roll and gives pieces too; Dorothy sees the five bones (cond
# 2) and asks again; Xenovia sells the powder for 1000 adena (cond 3), then sends him on;
# Dorothy waits; Orpheus buys the 2 pieces for 208; the medium jar rolls the scared girl (cond
# 7, every bone and the powder taken); Dorothy pays 3040 and, on a roll under 10, an imperial
# diamond, and the quest ends; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this
# scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q345_method_to_raise_the_dead.golden
character Dorothy 35
hold 57 1000
random 0 0 0 1 0 2 0 3 0 4 0 0 0 1 0 2 0
script quest.Q345_MethodToRaiseTheDead
item 57 4274 4275 4276 4277 4278 4280 4281 4310 3456
page default/30970.htm
page trainer/30912.htm
page default/30973.htm
page default/30971.htm
page script/quest/Q345_MethodToRaiseTheDead/
